WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,360
The identity of Liu Jialiang at the tea party

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,860
The tea party was a success

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:07,860
Liu Jialiang’s identity is a gunman

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,460
Gunner?

5
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:14,760
Is this why he dares to face the great man alone?

6
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:43,460
He ran away when there were many people.

7
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:54,090
Why did you go out alone?

8
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:55,590
Are you a great man?

9
00:00:55,590 --> 00:01:01,040
What do you want to do? Brother Lin

10
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,040
This is a great man

11
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:05,320
What did you do last night?
